# Phyrexian Unlife keeps its controller in only for having 0 or less life (CR 104.3d, 704.5c; the 2011-06-01 ruling).
# Bot1 begins at 1 life; Bot2's first Bolt takes Bot1 to -2 (life loss, no poison), and Bot2's Glistener Elf, with Giant
# Growth and Berserk, deals Bot1 8 infect damage: eight poison counters. Bot2's second Bolt is dealt as though it had infect:
# three more poison counters, eleven, and Bot1 loses to them - not to its life total.

